   "description": "ResearchWorld：E2E 任务用全部 9 个岗位；benchmark 题目按 HuTian 官方 benchmark 设置选岗位；所有岗位同一模型（Codex）",
   "description_en": "ResearchWorld: all 9 roles for E2E tasks; benchmark items take the roles of HuTian's own benchmark settings; the same model (Codex) in every role",
   "notes": "维护者 2026-10-29 加（#87）：所有岗位用 HuTian 现有的 Codex worker，gpt-6.1-sol、effort high，和 CX-sol 同模型同档 effort，成对比较“RW 用 Codex 能不能超过单个 Codex agent”。Codex 岗位直接用项目自己的 Codex 登录 `codex-2-rw`（HuTian 的 HT_CODEX_AUTH_FILE，不经 codex-api：HuTian 的强制代理只放行官方端点；`codex-2-rw` 是 `codex-2` 同一个账号的第二次独立登录，有自己的 refresh token，维护者 2026-11-02 定，#185），GPT 判官用 `codex`，所以和判官不共用登录和额度；和经 codex-api 用 `codex-2` 的 CX-sol、AS-sol、ARC-sol、EVO-sol 可以同时运行，只共用账号的用量额度（preflight 在同一批次里两者并存时打印 note）；RW-sol 和 RW-mixed 的 Codex 岗位读的是同一个登录文件，由 HuTian 自己的锁串行刷新。RW-astra 和混合版暂不加。",
   "notes_en": "Added by the maintainer on 2026-10-29 (#87): every role uses HuTian's existing Codex worker, gpt-6.1-sol at effort high, the same model and effort as CX-sol for a paired comparison of whether RW with Codex can beat a single Codex agent. The Codex roles use the project's own Codex login `codex-2-rw` directly (HuTian's HT_CODEX_AUTH_FILE, not through codex-api: HuTian's mandatory proxy admits only the official endpoints; `codex-2-rw` is a second, independent sign-in of the `codex-2` account with its own refresh token, maintainer, 2026-11-02, #185), and the GPT judges use `codex`, so they share neither the login nor the quota with the judges; RW-sol can run at the same time as CX-sol, AS-sol, ARC-sol and EVO-sol, which use `codex-2` through codex-api, and they only share the account's usage allowance (preflight prints a note when a batch holds both); RW-sol and the Codex roles of RW-mixed read the same login file, and HuTian's own lock serialises their refreshes. RW-astra and a mixed variant are not added for now.",
   "full_name": {
    "zh": "ResearchWorld：Codex CLI + GPT-6.1 Sol",
    "en": "ResearchWorld: Codex CLI + GPT-6.1 Sol"
